OPENAI_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o
LLM_MAX_TOKENS=16300
LLM_INSTRUCTIONS=- **DO NOT summarize or shorten.**\n- **Maintain the same word count or slightly expand the text.**\n- **Ensure the output has AT LEAST as many words as the input.**\n- **Do not remove key details or simplify concepts.**\n- **Maintain paragraph structures and overall format.**\n- **Aggressively rephrase and restructure the sentences to avoid similarity in form.**\n- **Use domain-specific synonyms and varied sentence constructions.**\n- **Avoid copying sentence flow or phrasing from the original.**\n- **If the input is vague or lacks context, still attempt a rewrite by mirroring and restructuring what is there.**
